  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Immovable Object" id="1dc9-0688-42bd-e0c3" hidden="false">
      <description>&quot;A Model with this Special Rule gains the Line Special Rule when it is not near an enemy unit.&quot;
During the Active Player&apos;s Move Phase, when a Unit in which every model has the Immovable Object Special Rule ends a move, if there are no opposing models within 12&quot; of that model, until the end of this Turn, Models in that Unit gain the Line (1) Special Rule</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
